  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7008.05 Conduct of the Commission Meetings. Roberts Rules of Order Newly Revised, 11th edition shall govern the procedures of the commission, available as noted in Appendix II.\n\nSource. #9091, eff 2-21-08 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 7000); ss by #11128, eff 6-29-16 (formerly Saf-C 7009.04)",
